  ('DS-PUMP-001-01', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 1, 1, 'Is this observed: Grease/oil leakage or discoloured grease at housing?', 'Grease/oil leakage or discoloured grease at housing', 'None (visual / observational)', 'Positive: contamination or lubrication loss; absence does not rule out internal wear', 'contamination or lubrication loss; absence does not rule out internal wear. Negative does not rule out.', 'Grease contaminated by water/dust leading to spalling of DE bearing raceway (supporting only)', 'Record finding and continue; after Tier 1 go to Tier 2. Do not conclude from visual checks alone.', 'Observe from safe distance; no contact with moving/hot/energised parts.', FALSE, 'S14; S01'),
  ('DS-PUMP-001-02', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 2, 1, 'Is this observed: Water marks, rust or dust ingress around housing?', 'Water marks, rust or dust ingress around housing', 'None (visual / observational)', 'Positive: ingress path to bearing', 'ingress path to bearing. Negative does not rule out.', 'Grease contaminated by water/dust leading to spalling of DE bearing raceway (supporting only)', 'Record finding and continue; after Tier 1 go to Tier 2. Do not conclude from visual checks alone.', 'Observe from safe distance; no contact with moving/hot/energised parts.', FALSE, 'S14; S01'),
  ('DS-PUMP-001-03', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 3, 1, 'Is this observed: Unusual noise heard from safe distance?', 'Unusual noise heard from safe distance', 'None (visual / observational)', 'Positive: rolling-element damage indicated; not specific to bearing without Tier 2', 'rolling-element damage indicated; not specific to bearing without Tier 2. Negative does not rule out.', 'Grease contaminated by water/dust leading to spalling of DE bearing raceway (supporting only)', 'Record finding and continue; after Tier 1 go to Tier 2. Do not conclude from visual checks alone.', 'Observe from safe distance; no contact with moving/hot/energised parts.', FALSE, 'S14; S01'),
  ('DS-PUMP-001-04', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 4, 2, 'What does Bearing housing vibration velocity/acceleration (spectrum) read compared with OEM/site baseline?', 'Bearing housing vibration velocity/acceleration (spectrum) at DE housing radial & axial', 'Vibration analyser/accelerometer', 'Reading compared with OEM specification or approved site baseline (mm/s or g (per instrument/standard))', 'bearing-defect frequencies and raised high-frequency noise point to bearing; compare to ISO 20816 method and site baseline', 'See differential diagnosis: Misalignment: 2x running-speed and axial vibration; Cavitation: broadband high-frequency noise varying with suction conditions; Looseness: harmonics,', 'If consistent with suspected cause AND alternatives excluded, request supervisor review for Tier 3; if ambiguous, repeat or escalate.', 'Trained personnel only; electrical measurements by qualified persons under approved procedure.', FALSE, 'S03; S14'),
  ('DS-PUMP-001-05', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 5, 2, 'What does Bearing housing surface temperature read compared with OEM/site baseline?', 'Bearing housing surface temperature at DE housing', 'IR thermometer (non-contact)', 'Reading compared with OEM specification or approved site baseline (°C)', 'trend vs baseline and vs NDE; OEM limit required', 'See differential diagnosis: Misalignment: 2x running-speed and axial vibration; Cavitation: broadband high-frequency noise varying with suction conditions; Looseness: harmonics,', 'If consistent with suspected cause AND alternatives excluded, request supervisor review for Tier 3; if ambiguous, repeat or escalate.', 'Trained personnel only; electrical measurements by qualified persons under approved procedure.', FALSE, 'S03; S14'),
  ('DS-PUMP-001-06', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 6, 2, 'What does Motor current (qualified person) read compared with OEM/site baseline?', 'Motor current (qualified person) at Starter output', 'Clamp meter', 'Reading compared with OEM specification or approved site baseline (A)', 'normal current supports non-hydraulic cause', 'See differential diagnosis: Misalignment: 2x running-speed and axial vibration; Cavitation: broadband high-frequency noise varying with suction conditions; Looseness: harmonics,', 'If consistent with suspected cause AND alternatives excluded, request supervisor review for Tier 3; if ambiguous, repeat or escalate.', 'Trained personnel only; electrical measurements by qualified persons under approved procedure.', FALSE, 'S03; S14'),
  ('DS-PUMP-001-07', 'a60095b1-9cb4-53f9-9aa6-bca32dc3f4ab', 7, 3, 'Has the supervisor approved the corrective action and has LOTO been applied?', 'Isolate (LOTO), drain/depressurise, remove coupling guard and coupling, replace DE bearing set, inspect shaft journal/housing fits, clean housing, refill with OEM-specified lubricant, re-align, reinstall guard.', 'Per OEM procedure and site LOTO', 'Fault confirmed by Tier 2 results and differential diagnosis', 'Repair addresses Grease contaminated by water/dust leading to spalling of DE bearing raceway', 'Grease contaminated by water/dust leading to spalling of DE bearing raceway', 'Execute only after supervisor approval + LOTO, then run post-repair verification (repeat Tier 2).', 'LOTO mandatory; verify zero energy / depressurised; follow OEM manual.', TRUE, 'S10; S14'),
  ('DS-PUMP-002-01', 'f7af7d7d-0fb8-5394-8b46-cc840dee39b9', 1, 1, 'Is this observed: Leak location (gland, flange, sleeve) and rate?', 'Leak location (gland, flange, sleeve) and rate', 'None (visual / observational)', 'Positive: identifies seal vs joint leak', 'identifies seal vs joint leak. Negative does not rule out.', 'Seal faces worn/damaged by dry running at start-up (supporting only)', 'Record finding and continue; after Tier 1 go to Tier 2. Do not conclude from visual checks alone.', 'Observe from safe distance; no contact with moving/hot/energised parts.', FALSE, 'S14; S01'),
  ('DS-PUMP-002-02', 'f7af7d7d-0fb8-5394-8b46-cc840dee39b9', 2, 1, 'Is this observed: Fluid colour/smell and slip hazards?', 'Fluid colour/smell and slip hazards', 'None (visual / observational)', 'Positive: product type and hazard awareness', 'product type and hazard awareness. Negative does not rule out.', 'Seal faces worn/damaged by dry running at start-up (supporting only)', 'Record finding and continue; after Tier 1 go to Tier 2. Do not conclude from visual checks alone.', 'Observe from safe distance; no contact with moving/hot/energised parts.', FALSE, 'S14; S01'),
  ('DS-PUMP-002-03', 'f7af7d7d-0fb8-5394-8b46-cc840dee39b9', 3, 1, 'Is this observed: Flush/quench line condition visible?', 'Flush/quench line condition visible', 'None (visual / observational)', 'Positive: blocked or missing flush supports seal-environment cause', 'blocked or missing flush supports seal-environment cause. Negative does not rule out.', 'Seal faces worn/damaged by dry running at start-up (supporting only)', 'Record finding and continue; after Tier 1 go to Tier 2. Do not conclude from visual checks alone.', 'Observe from safe distance; no contact with moving/hot/energised parts.', FALSE, 'S14; S01'),
  ('DS-PUMP-002-04', 'f7af7d7d-0fb8-5394-8b46-cc840dee39b9', 4, 2, 'What does Seal chamber/gland housing surface temperature read compared with OEM/site baseline?', 'Seal chamber/gland housing surface temperature at Seal housing', 'IR thermometer', 'Reading compared with OEM specification or approved site baseline (°C)', 'elevated vs baseline suggests face contact/dry running', 'See differential diagnosis: Bearing/shaft deflection: vibration rise; Elastomer leak: leakage between sleeve and seal; Gland packing leak: adjustable and different drip pattern.', 'If consistent with suspected cause AND alternatives excluded, request supervisor review for Tier 3; if ambiguous, repeat or escalate.', 'Trained personnel only; electrical measurements by qualified persons under approved procedure.', FALSE, 'S03; S14'),
  ('DS-PUMP-002-05', 'f7af7d7d-0fb8-5394-8b46-cc840dee39b9', 5, 2, 'What does Suction and discharge pressure read compared with OEM/site baseline?', 'Suction and discharge pressure at Taps', 'Calibrated gauges', 'Reading compared with OEM specification or approved site baseline (bar or kPa (per gauge))', 'confirms operation within OEM seal pressure rating', 'See differential diagnosis: Bearing/shaft deflection: vibration rise; Elastomer leak: leakage between sleeve and seal; Gland packing leak: adjustable and different drip pattern.', 'If consistent with suspected cause AND alternatives excluded, request supervisor review for Tier 3; if ambiguous, repeat or escalate.', 'Trained personnel only; electrical measurements by qualified persons under approved procedure.', FALSE, 'S03; S14'),
